[{"id": 35570034, "text": "This activity is all about looking at incorrectly spelled words and thinking about how to check them! You don't need to know the correct spellings - you just need to talk about how you might work them out!", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": "1633524888903_1image1-01FHATQ0F350A4V0FMR5VBJNRT.png", "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 35569907, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"inputArray": [[]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40832781, "text": "<h2>The Activity:</h2>\nHere are some words that are spelled incorrectly: \n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35569907, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40833045, "text": "Stuck?", "modal": {"steps": [{"id": 40832992, "text": "Have a look at what we thought about the words:\n<br></br>\n<table style cellpadding=\"10px\" border=\"1\">\n  <tr>\n    <td><span style=\"font-family:'Sassoon Infant Rg'\"><span style =\"font-size:200%\">accidentaly<br> favorite </span></span></td>\n    <td>These two are easiest to look up. The beginning of the words looks ok but we’d like to check the middles and endings.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><span style=\"font-family:'Sassoon Infant Rg'\"><span style =\"font-size:200%\">fotograph <br>knawing</span></span></td>\n    <td>These are harder to look up. That’s because the sounds at the start of the words are spelled incorrectly, and we need to know the first letters to be able to check. They should begin with ‘ph’ and ‘gn’.</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td><span style=\"font-family:'Sassoon Infant Rg'\"><span style =\"font-size:200%\">thair <br>waight</span></span></td>\n    <td>These are harder to look up for a different reason – there are several homophones for each one (words that sound the same but are spelled differently). We’d need to read the word in a sentence to figure out which was correct.</td>\n</tr>\n</table>\n", "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "modalId": 39, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": null, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}], "details": {"id": 39, "name": "Stuck?", "logCreatedAt": "2021-11-09T09:58:06.066471", "logUpdatedAt": "2021-11-09T09:58:06.066471", "logCreatedById": null, "logUpdatedById": null, "nameForContentDev": null}}, "order": 5, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "MODAL", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35569907, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 39, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40832899, "text": "\nfotograph \n<br>accidentaly \n<br>thair  \n<br>favorite \n<br>knawing  \n<br>waight \n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": 32, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "EDITOR", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35569907, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": "<p><span style=\"font-size:32px;font-family:SassoonInfantRg-Regular;\">\nfotograph \n<br>accidentaly \n<br>thair  \n<br>favorite \n<br>knawing  \n<br>waight \n</span></p>", "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40832883, "text": "Talk about these questions together:\n<ul>\n<li>Which words do you just know the correct spellings for?</li>\n<li>Which are easy to look up in a dictionary? Why?</li>\n<li>Which words are harder to look up in a dictionary? Why?</li>\n<li>How could you check the spellings if you didn’t have a dictionary?</li>\n</ul", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 4, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 35569907, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]